# synth-tt_um.ys — mapped netlist for the post-SERDES tt_um_top STA screen.
# Same flow as synth-pe_soc.ys, with the top-level source list from
# regress/synth_area.sh (pe_ctrl + the wrapper included). The wrapper is where
# the overlay→pad path leaves pe_soc, so the top-level screen is the one that
# sees the complete pin path.
